# Preservation archive — store and check out every file byte for byte.
#
# No end-of-line translation anywhere.  Tape and printer-listing sources
# carry meaningful CRLF/CR, ports are verified by byte-exact comparison,
# and several "text" files are really 36-bit words, EBCDIC, or PETSCII.
# Without this line, anyone cloning with core.autocrlf=true (the common
# Git-for-Windows default) would silently get rewritten line endings.
* -text

# Git LFS is deliberately NOT configured.  .gitignore keeps every
# multi-hundred-MB emulator disk image out of the repository, so nothing
# tracked here needs it.  Do not re-add filter=lfs lines without
# checking what they would pull in.
